title: Raritan PX2 Devices External Sensors: Pressure
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors pressure sensors connected to a Raritan PX2 device.
 No configuration is needed, the devices send their states by themselves.

 The displayed value retains the device unit. PSI readings and their metric
 thresholds are converted to Pascal for the pressure_pa performance metric
 using 1 psi = 6894.757293168 Pa. Pascal readings remain unchanged.

item:
 Sensor followed by the sensor ID and name, e.g. Sensor 1 Air.
 The PDU ID is prefixed only when multiple PDUs are found, e.g. 1/Sensor 1 Air.

discovery:
 One service is created for each sensor.
